      <h1>Shipping cost &amp; transit time from China to Bahrain: duty, VAT and the single-port reality</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Most China-to-Bahrain quotes arrive as one number. The island’s real cost is three: the
        freight line, the ×1.155 statutory stack (5% duty, then 10% VAT on the duty-inclusive base —
        the second-highest VAT load in the GCC), and a destination fee schedule that a single-port
        market does not compete away. This page separates them, flags the freight prints that are
        already stale, and shows you what to ask when the published data runs thin.
      </p>

