  <section class="section container">
    <h2>9. Beyond freight: destination fees, demurrage and the free-time clock</h2>
    <p>
      The destination fee stack is where a Bahrain quote earns or loses its credibility. The
      statutory lines — 5% duty and 10% VAT — are the same for everyone. The operational lines are
      not, and the snapshot did not quantify them, so the only way to compare providers is to make
      them itemise. Line by line, deliberately.
    </p>

    <DataTable
      columns={[
        { key: 'factor', label: 'Factor' },
        { key: 'effect', label: 'Effect on cost or time' },
        { key: 'note', label: 'Planning note' },
        { key: 'confidence', label: 'Confidence', type: 'confidence' },
      ]}
